WEBVTT

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:10.410
Thank you!

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.580
Please come again soon!

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.080
Boy, Chocola worked hard today, as always!

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:23.790
Business was slow today, but not unusually so.

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:27.910
Chocola is so hungry!

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:31.120
Oh?!

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:34.370
What's wrong, Chocola?

00:00:37.790 --> 00:00:39.080
Cacao?

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:42.750
Were you waiting to welcome us back?

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:52.250
Thank you, Cacao.

00:00:53.790 --> 00:00:57.410
Chocola, don't monopolize Cacao.

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:10.370
This is like back in the day,
when we used to wait for Master like this.

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:15.750
Want to try again today?
Maybe he will pat us on the head.

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:18.160
Yes, agreed!

00:01:19.370 --> 00:01:21.910
Phew, that went long.

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:28.910
Great work, Master!

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.450
Yeah, same for you.

00:01:38.290 --> 00:01:39.540
Hmm?

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:40.950
Master?

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:43.080
Cold reception today.

00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:21.750
Wow, looks delicious!

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:23.580
Let's eat!

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:36.330
Master, this soy sauce-boiled
dried fish is delicious!

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:38.830
I see...

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:44.250
Master! The rice is cooked so fresh
and fluffy--it's absolutely awesome!

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:46.250
Uh-huh.

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:51.750
By the way, Master, Chocola worked
super-hard at work today!

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:54.410
Yeah...

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:59.580
Chocola, eat quietly.

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:00.950
Yes...

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:03.410
Thanks for the food.

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:05.250
What, already?!

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:18.200
Master didn't talk at all during dinner.

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:22.080
Maybe there's something wrong with
the shop that's worrying him?

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:24.250
The shop? Could it be...?

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:29.620
Chocola, if you know something,
be honest about it.

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:33.700
Turn yourself in now and
your punishment might be lighter.

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:35.580
Wh-What?!

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:39.660
Well, maybe, just maybe...

00:04:40.910 --> 00:04:45.410
Chocola did take a tiny taste of
the cream during work the other day!

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:49.500
When Chocola was carrying
lots of plates at once...

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:53.330
Chocola fell and broke them...

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:57.250
Maybe he found all of it out!

00:04:57.250 --> 00:05:00.290
Such a bad cat will get this...

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:01.370
Grind, grind...

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:04.450
Ow, ow, ow!

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:08.370
No more! Chocola will never do it again!

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:14.000
Well, setting Chocola's evil deeds aside...

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:15.660
You're setting them aside?!

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:18.910
Master was a bit weird today.

00:05:18.910 --> 00:05:21.370
What?! You mean his health?!

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:23.410
Maybe he ate something bad...

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:26.200
No, not like that.

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:29.040
When I went into the kitchen today...

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:34.580
This isn't working out at all...

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:39.370
Really...

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:43.410
Maybe the shop isn't doing well financially.

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:45.950
There were fewer customers today.

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:48.450
What do you mean, "financially"?!

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:50.830
First, we will get less food.

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:52.750
What?!

00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:54.660
You mean...

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:57.290
We eat like one dried fish a day?!

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:01.910
No way!

00:06:01.910 --> 00:06:02.750
--No way, no way! No way!

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:04.540
--Don't worry.
--No way, no way! No way!

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:07.540
--There's no need for Cacao to worry.
--No way, no way! No way!

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:11.370
We should solve this for our master.

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:13.290
Yes, you're right!

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:15.830
We have to save Master!

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:24.500
The first step to increasing customers
is to raise our recognition.

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:26.830
Let's hand out tons of shop cards!

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:28.250
Yeah.

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:35.700
Oh, right... You don't know
what these are, do you, Cacao?

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:39.790
These cards has the name of our shop and a map.

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:45.580
Customers who see this can flock to our shop.

00:06:45.580 --> 00:06:47.790
Also, our food would be safe.

00:06:51.410 --> 00:06:54.080
We are Patisserie La Soleil!

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:56.080
We have delicious cakes!

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:58.330
Please come visit us.

00:06:58.330 --> 00:06:59.910
We are La Soleil!

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:02.580
We have delicious cakes!

00:07:02.580 --> 00:07:04.080
Hey, you three.

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:06.870
What are you doing so early?

00:07:06.870 --> 00:07:08.620
Cinnamon, Maple.

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:10.330
Good timing!

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:14.790
I see, the shop's sales...

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:18.330
Can you think of a good way
to bring in more customers?

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:20.040
Let's see...

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:23.290
Seems like it's time for us to step up and help.

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:26.830
What?! We're going to step onto a stage?!

00:07:26.830 --> 00:07:32.330
G-Getting nude in front of a crowd... That's...

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:38.290
Oh, Cinnamon... would become moist!

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:42.450
Yeah, yeah. As usual, that's not what I said.

00:07:46.870 --> 00:07:49.370
Five tiramisu to go.

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:50.370
Here you are.

00:07:51.290 --> 00:07:52.660
Okay, ready?

00:07:56.870 --> 00:08:00.790
Wow, so cute! Thanks, kitties!

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:03.200
"Hello, everyone! Customers who purchase
at least one cake with us will get a photo
shoot for free! Please visit us at La Soleil!"
What do you think?

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:04.870
"Hello, everyone! Customers who purchase
at least one cake with us will get a photo
shoot for free! Please visit us at La Soleil!"
Cat photo service for people who buy cakes!

00:08:04.870 --> 00:08:07.830
"#Soleil #Cat #Cute"
Cat photo service for people who buy cakes!

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:11.700
I posted it yesterday and the word
seems to have spread so far already!

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:14.750
Impressive as usual, May. You're so smart.

00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:17.040
Wow, so many customers!

00:08:17.040 --> 00:08:19.290
You're up next, Chocola and Vanilla.

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:20.330
Y-Yes!

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:22.330
I... I'll do my best...

00:08:23.660 --> 00:08:26.580
Thank you for waiting. Here are two cake sets.

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:30.450
Would that be all for you today?

00:08:30.450 --> 00:08:32.540
Yes, thank you.

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:33.950
Okay, here I go.

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:38.830
Chocola, you're too close to the camera.

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:40.750
Smile more naturally.

00:08:45.660 --> 00:08:49.200
Chocola has to up her game, too! Meow!

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:53.290
Like this?

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:54.540
Yeah!

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:04.870
Seems like a lot more
orders are coming in today.

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:06.910
I'd better work harder!

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:37.200
"Kinoshita"

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:38.200
"Nishimura"

00:10:38.830 --> 00:10:40.250
"Yoshikawa"

00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:42.200
"Tamura"

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:43.790
"Kawada"

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:23.120
Oh, I'm sorry. Are you okay?

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:25.950
Are you hurt?

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:37.790
Oh, a kitty! So cute!

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:44.370
Wh-What is it?

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:52.370
This <i>taiyaki </i>is from a stall in this park.

00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:53.700
It's yummy.

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:57.750
Here. Do you want the head or the tail?

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:04.080
The head? Sure.

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:19.080
I'm Chiyo. What's your name?

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:23.620
Where is your house?

00:12:25.750 --> 00:12:27.160
Who is your master?

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:32.790
Are you... lost?

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:42.410
I see... Well, let me help.

00:12:44.870 --> 00:12:46.330
Come here, kitty!

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:54.540
Hello.

00:12:55.450 --> 00:13:00.700
Hmm... The police station is
the best place to take a lost kitty to, but...

00:13:02.200 --> 00:13:09.000
Um... it's fine. What to do...

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:11.700
Oh, I know! Let's ask a grown-up.

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:14.290
Oh, e-excuse me!

00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:18.830
Th-There's a lost kitty.
I'm looking for her house...

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:21.290
A kitty? Where?

00:13:21.290 --> 00:13:22.330
Huh?

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:24.160
Wh-What?!

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:26.040
Kitty, where did you go?

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:30.660
Oh, there!

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:34.000
Why would you take off like that?

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:39.250
A quick gift for Kashou... This one!

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:40.790
"Red Bean Ice Cream"
Red bean ice cream!

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:44.330
What are you talking about?
Obviously, this one is better!

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:45.950
Coconut ice bar!

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:49.580
What?! Don't you know how stiff
the red bean ice cream is?!

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:52.790
Yeah, you're the expert on being a stiff.

00:13:58.370 --> 00:14:00.160
Wait!

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:04.620
Did I just see Cacao? Or not?

00:14:04.620 --> 00:14:05.790
Huh?

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:12.910
What's wrong, kitty?

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:17.830
Is this your house?

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.660
I guess not...

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:24.830
Cakes...

00:14:24.830 --> 00:14:28.330
Is your house a cake shop?

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:34.040
I see! So we need to find a cake shop!

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:36.450
This one?

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:40.830
"Kuramae Confectionary Shop"
This one?

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:42.160
"French Confectionaries COCO CORNER"
"10% OFF Cake Specials" "Season's Gifts"
"COCO CORNER'S Short Cakes"
How about here?

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:44.200
"French Confectionaries COCO CORNER"
"10% OFF Cake Specials" "Season's Gifts"
"COCO CORNER'S Short Cakes"

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:47.500
We can't find your house...

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:49.750
Any other hints?

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:57.040
Hmm?

00:14:57.040 --> 00:15:02.580
Dead end... I guess I took a wrong turn.

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:06.790
There's supposed to be a way
to the big street around here...

00:15:14.250 --> 00:15:17.660
D-Don't worry... Don't be scared.

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:33.870
Let's go...

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:43.370
W-Wait!

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:46.250
Kitty, you're so fast...

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:52.330
No!

00:16:04.870 --> 00:16:06.040
Kitty!

00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:08.000
Are you okay?

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:09.120
Hurry!

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:13.910
Kitty, this way!

00:16:33.700 --> 00:16:35.000
No way!

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:43.790
What should we do...?

00:16:59.750 --> 00:17:01.620
Wait, kitty!

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:06.040
No!

00:17:29.950 --> 00:17:33.330
Oh... We're safe.

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:38.120
Thank you for that, kitty.

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:41.200
Is there something you want?
I want to repay you.

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:43.950
<i>Taiyaki.</i>

00:17:43.950 --> 00:17:48.250
You must like that a lot!
I'll get you one as soon as I find--

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:55.790
"Famous Taiyaki"

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:04.830
Back when I lived in my old house,
I lived with a kitty, too.

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:09.120
She lived with my grandmother for a long time.

00:18:09.120 --> 00:18:11.620
We ate <i>taiyaki </i>together.

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:14.080
We played together
when I was very small.

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:21.830
But we had to move
because of my dad's work.

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:27.620
No! I won't leave her!

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:31.660
I ran out of the house, and I got lost.

00:18:31.660 --> 00:18:33.910
The kitty came to find me.

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:40.700
Your grandma and the others are worried.
Let's go home, Chiyo.

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:44.000
Okay.

00:18:50.660 --> 00:18:53.830
Are you worried about me?

00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:57.450
Thank you, kitty.

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:00.910
Cacao.

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:02.330
Huh?

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:06.450
Cacao? Is your name Cacao, kitty?

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:09.330
Chiyo.

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:11.830
Thank you.

00:19:14.410 --> 00:19:16.580
You finally spoke!

00:19:23.450 --> 00:19:25.040
Is this...?

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:27.910
Hey, you guys.

00:19:27.910 --> 00:19:30.700
"Cat Lover: Just went to the photo shoot
at Soleil! The cats are so cute!
#Soleil #Cat #Cute"
What is this photo?

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:32.790
U-Uhh...

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:34.870
That's, um...

00:19:34.870 --> 00:19:38.700
A small ad campaign of sorts...

00:19:39.410 --> 00:19:42.450
I see, I understand now.

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:46.330
But what I was concerned
about isn't the shop's sales.

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:48.250
--Huh?!
--It's this.

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:53.000
I couldn't come up with
a new cake for the summer season.

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:55.580
That's what I've been thinking about.

00:19:55.580 --> 00:19:57.750
W-We jumped the gun?!

00:19:58.750 --> 00:20:00.700
A most shameful experience.

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:05.160
We are a patisserie.
Don't do these things anymore, okay?

00:20:05.160 --> 00:20:07.200
Yes.

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:11.330
But I'm glad you worked so hard for the shop.

00:20:11.330 --> 00:20:14.870
That did help boost my motivation,
and I came up with a new cake.

00:20:14.870 --> 00:20:18.160
Thanks, Chocola, Vanilla.

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:21.040
Master!

00:20:21.040 --> 00:20:22.370
Master...

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:25.540
--Cacao?
--Yeah.

00:20:25.540 --> 00:20:27.000
Did you see her at the shop?

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:31.200
We were really busy the whole time.
I don't think I saw her.

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:35.330
Do you think it really was Cacao
back there in the streets?

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:36.790
No way.

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:40.540
Really? Where did you see her?

00:20:40.540 --> 00:20:42.500
Down by the apartments, but...

00:20:42.500 --> 00:20:45.290
Cacao might be lost again!

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:46.750
We have to find her.

00:20:46.750 --> 00:20:47.870
Just wait.

00:20:49.290 --> 00:20:50.700
Master...

00:20:50.700 --> 00:20:53.120
Cacao is waiting for us at home, right?

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:55.580
Y-Yes, she's supposed to be, but...

00:20:56.660 --> 00:20:57.910
Cacao?

00:20:58.410 --> 00:20:59.410
Hmm?

00:20:59.410 --> 00:21:00.870
Not here.

00:21:00.870 --> 00:21:02.250
Living room?

00:21:02.250 --> 00:21:03.540
Maybe.

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:08.290
Master!

00:21:08.290 --> 00:21:10.500
Please don't stop so suddenly...

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:12.700
Cacao!

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:14.660
You were here the whole time?

00:21:14.660 --> 00:21:17.950
Were you waiting for us to come back? Thanks.

00:21:20.830 --> 00:21:23.200
Oh, thank goodness.

00:21:23.200 --> 00:21:25.000
Chocola, you panic too easily.

00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:29.500
Ch-Chocola wasn't panicking!
If Chocola was panicking, so were you!

00:21:30.870 --> 00:21:33.040
See you, Cacao-<i>cha</i>n!

00:21:35.830 --> 00:21:39.160
Cacao, Chocola will entertain you now!

00:21:39.160 --> 00:21:41.750
More like she will entertain Chocola.

00:23:16.950 --> 00:23:21.870
"Illustration by: Kani Biimu"
"Please watch again!"
